{
  "info": {
    "name": "honoapi",
    "description": "Hono.js + Cloudflare Workers + Neon DB — REST API\n\n**Setup:**\n1. Set `baseUrl` variable to your domain\n2. Call `POST /auth/register` or `POST /auth/login` — token is auto-saved\n3. All protected routes use the saved `{{token}}` automatically",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "https://honoapi.morogroup.workers.dev",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Base URL — change to http://localhost:8787 for local dev"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "JWT token — auto-set after login or register"
    }
  ],
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔍 Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Root",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": [""] },
            "description": "Returns API status and timestamp"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["health"] }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🔐 Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', res.token);",
                  "    console.log('✅ Token saved. User ID:', res.user?.id);",
                  "    console.log('ℹ️  FREE plan auto-assigned on register');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"John Doe\",\n  \"email\": \"john@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "register"] },
            "description": "Register a new user.\n\n✅ Token auto-saved to `{{token}}`.\n📦 FREE plan is automatically assigned."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (res.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', res.token);",
                  "    console.log('✅ Token saved. User ID:', res.user?.id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"john@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] },
            "description": "Login — token auto-saved to `{{token}}`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "me"] },
            "description": "Returns current user info from JWT payload.\n🔒 Requires token."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "💳 Plans & Subscriptions",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List Plans (Public)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/plans", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["plans"] },
            "description": "🌐 Public — no auth required.\nReturns all active plans for your pricing page.\n\nPlans: FREE / PRO / PREMIUM\nPrices in cents (999 = $9.99)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "My Subscription",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/subscriptions/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "subscriptions", "me"] },
            "description": "🔒 Requires token.\nReturns your current plan, billing period and status."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "My Usage (Current Period)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/subscriptions/usage", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "subscriptions", "usage"] },
            "description": "🔒 Requires token.\nReturns current month's feature usage counts.\nUse this to build usage dashboards / progress bars."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Change Plan",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"planCode\": \"PRO\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/subscriptions/change-plan", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "subscriptions", "change-plan"] },
            "description": "🔒 Requires token.\nUpgrade or downgrade plan.\n\nValid values: FREE | PRO | PREMIUM\n\nℹ️  In production this is triggered by Stripe/Paddle webhook after payment.\nEntitlement cache is invalidated immediately on change."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "👤 Users",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List All Users",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "users"] },
            "description": "🔒 Requires token. Returns all users (no passwordHash)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get My Profile",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/me", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "users", "me"] },
            "description": "🔒 Requires token. Returns your own profile via JWT."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get User by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/1", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "users", "1"] },
            "description": "🔒 Requires token."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update User (own only)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Updated Name\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/1", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "users", "1"] },
            "description": "🔒 Requires token.\n⚠️ 403 if you try another user's ID."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete User (own only)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/users/1", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "users", "1"] },
            "description": "🔒 Requires token.\n⚠️ 403 if you try another user's ID."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "📝 Posts",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List All Posts",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/posts", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "posts"] },
            "description": "🔒 Requires token."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Post by ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/posts/1", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "posts", "1"] },
            "description": "🔒 Requires token."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Post",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"My First Post\",\n  \"content\": \"Hello from honoapi!\",\n  \"userId\": 1\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/posts", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "posts"] },
            "description": "🔒 Requires token."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Post",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Updated Title\",\n  \"content\": \"Updated content.\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/posts/1", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "posts", "1"] },
            "description": "🔒 Requires token."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete Post",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/posts/1", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["api", "posts", "1"] },
            "description": "🔒 Requires token."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "🧪 Entitlement Demo",
      "description": "These requests demonstrate the checkEntitlement middleware.\nAdd similar routes to your own SaaS features.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Check Access — api_requests (FREE: 100/mo)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 429) {",
                  "    console.log('🚫 LIMIT REACHED:', res.error);",
                  "    console.log('Used:', res.error?.used, '/', res.error?.limit);",
                  "} else if (pm.response.code === 403) {",
                  "    console.log('🚫 PLAN FEATURE NOT INCLUDED:', res.error);",
                  "} else {",
                  "    console.log('✅ Access granted');",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/subscriptions/usage",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "subscriptions", "usage"]
            },
            "description": "View current usage vs your plan limits.\n\nExpected responses:\n✅ 200 — access granted, shows usage counts\n🚫 429 — USAGE_LIMIT_REACHED (with limit/used in body)\n🚫 403 — feature not on your plan\n\nExample 429 response:\n```json\n{\n  \"error\": {\n    \"code\": \"USAGE_LIMIT_REACHED\",\n    \"featureCode\": \"api_requests\",\n    \"limit\": 100,\n    \"used\": 100\n  }\n}\n```"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Upgrade to PRO then Check Again",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"planCode\": \"PRO\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/subscriptions/change-plan",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "subscriptions", "change-plan"]
            },
            "description": "Upgrade to PRO to unlock higher limits.\nEntitlement cache is invalidated automatically."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
